  "details": "1. When the real height is matched with the actual height, the tracker position is gathered together, which is different from the actual scale\n\n2. When the real height is set automatically, it is displayed as 110 cm and the tracker position is moved to a position similar to the actual one, but the wrist movement is moving strangely\n\nWhen running the Quest pro alone, the real height is displayed as 170cm.\n\nWhen running on Quest 2(Virtual desktop+STEAM VR), the real height is displayed as 170cm.\n\nIn both cases, the controller scale difference bug did not occur.\n\nAttempted Troubleshooting\n\nAttempt to change avatar (private, public)\n\nSteam VR clean reinstall (appdata, delete)\n\nTurn off face tracking and FBT and try running\n\nvrchat, trying to run steam vr beta version\n\nvrchat clean reinstall (appdata, registry delete)\n\nquest pro boundary set floor level\n\nsteam vr boundary set floor level\n\nquest pro factory reset\n\nVirtual desktop, steam link, airlink same symptoms\n\ncontroler binding reset(default)",
